<#ff3c46>BLOOD GAUGE / KAMUI</>
Kamui (Blood gauge full)		^X
  The Blood gauge fills as she deals and takes damage.
  When it's full, X turns Senketsu into Kamui for 12 s:
  more damage, less damage taken, free EX moves, and
  every super becomes its Max version. Using a super
  ends Kamui. Also cancels a ground normal on contact.

<#ff3c46>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Zero Counter (while blocking, 1 bar)		_B_DB_D^A
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U

<#ff3c46>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium		_D^A / _D^B
Sweep		_D^C
Launcher		_DF^C
  Hold up after it hits to jump after them, then
  chain air A > B > C. Air normals juggle.
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Light chains into medium, medium into heavy.

<#ff3c46>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is the EX (500 meter).
Life Fiber Blast (air too)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Blade Dash (air too)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Uppercut		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Scissor Spin (air too)		_B_D_DB^A / ^B / ^C
Flip Slash		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Stomp (air)		_D_D^A / ^B / ^C

<#ff3c46>SUPERS (1 bar; Max versions in Kamui)</>
Hyper Life Fiber Blast (air too)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Hyper Uppercut		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^B_+^C
Hyper Blade Dash		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Hyper Scissor Spin		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^B_+^C
Hyper Flip Slash		_F_DF_D_DB_B_F^A_+^B
Life Fiber Barrage		_F_DF_D_DB_B_F^B_+^C
Hyper Stomp (air)		_D_D^B_+^C
Sen-I-Soshitsu (3 bars)		_F_B_F_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A/B/C work. 1 bar in Kamui.
